{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44980","headline":"奉和裴使君清春夜南堂听陈山人弹白雪 · 皎然","name":"奉和裴使君清春夜南堂听陈山人弹白雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春宵凝丽思，闲坐开南围。\n郢客弹白雪，纷纶发金徽。\n散从天上至，集向琼台飞。\n弦上凝飒飒，虚中想霏霏。\n通幽鬼神骇，合道精鉴稀。\n变态风更入，含情月初归。\n方知阮太守，一听识其微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}